        {
          "text": "Makekangya vetha woo nzĩanĩ nene, na thaavu woo ũkeethĩwa ta kĩndũ kĩvuku; vetha woo na thaavu woo itikatonya kũmavonokya mũthenya wa ũthilĩku wa Yeova: itikavũn’ya mathayũ moo, kana kusũsya mavu moo; nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩsyo syamalulutĩkilye ũthũkunĩ woo. ",
